  "title": "Grilled Mussels with Curry Butter",
  "description": "In this terrific recipe, top mussels with a rich curry butter, seal in foil packets, and grill until done. Serve as an appetizer with crusty bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana S"
  ],
